scope one survey written and graded; no file moved, no row filed, no cut opened
status GREEN -- QA 88 at Field, reach 100, truth 100; the molt itself waits on Keaton's word
recommend check in (Keaton) -- the seating is his to circle, and the one bundling worth naming first is that SOURCE.md is already booked twice.
